Modifications

This repository (Colibri_Qwen_Optimization,
https://github.com/MostafaaElhadidy/Colibri_Qwen_Optimization) is a
modified version of colibri (https://github.com/JustVugg/colibri),
based on colibri commit e0db083cdc9e563e0766cc6fc661ef23c32298e0.

Modifications Copyright 2026 Mostafa Elhadidy, licensed under the
Apache License, Version 2.0, as above. Changed or added files:

  c/qwen36.c                         parallel miss loading (COLI_Q36_MISS_QD),
                                     prefill waves (COLI_Q36_PREFILL_WAVES*),
                                     grouped kernel switch (COLI_Q36_PREFILL_GROUPED),
                                     slot arena (COLI_Q36_SLOT_ARENA),
                                     fault profiler (COLI_Q36_FAULT_PROF)
  c/expert_ffn.h                     xf_moe_combine, xf_dot_i8_x4, xf_moe_compute_ex
  c/tests/test_qwen36_cache_index.c  batch and waves tests
  benchmarks/expert_cache_research/  benchmark kit and results (added)
  docs/expert_cache_research*.md, docs/STATUS.md,
  docs/colibri_optimization_results.pdf, docs/report_src/  (added)
  assets/optimization/               README graphics (added)
  README.md                          project README (new); the original
                                     colibri README is README.colibri.md
  README.*.md                        language links point to README.colibri.md
  CLAUDE.md, CITATION.cff            (added)

All new behaviour is behind environment flags that are off by default;
with every flag off the engine produces the original's output bit for bit.
